name: Lucky Cat + Showman
author: for pi — Lucky Cat with Showman locked in early
description: >-
  MUST have both Showman and Lucky Cat in antes 1-3 (Showman lets the Cat's
  duplicates and luck stack persist), riding a curated negative-Perkeo (Zerkeo)
  seed. Oops! All 6s is the bonus — it doubles every lucky roll so the Cat eats
  twice as fast.
deck: Red
name: Lucky Cat + Showman (Negative Oops Engine)
author: for pi — Lucky Cat with Showman + free Negative Oops from Anaglyph
description: >-
  Anaglyph deck doubles every Negative Tag from small blind skips. Showman lets
  Lucky Cat and Oops All 6s stack through duplicates. Only score Oops in
  shopItems 2+ — 0 and 1 are locked on landing, can't be skipped to.
deck: Anaglyph
stake: White
must:
  - uncommonJoker: Showman
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    max: 1
  - uncommonJoker: LuckyCat
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
should:
  - uncommonJoker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]
  - uncommonJoker: LuckyCat
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
  - smallBlindTag: NegativeTag
    antes: [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]
should:
  - and:
    - smallBlindTag: NegativeTag
      antes: [2]
    - joker: OopsAll6s
      sources:
        shopItems: [2, 3, 4]
      antes: [2]
    score: 70
  - and:
    - smallBlindTag: NegativeTag
      antes: [3]
    - joker: OopsAll6s
      sources:
        shopItems: [2, 3, 4, 5, 6]
      antes: [3]
    score: 70
  - and:
    - smallBlindTag: NegativeTag
      antes: [4]
    - joker: OopsAll6s
      sources:
        shopItems: [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10]
      antes: [4]
    score: 70
